AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000369> "* According to the 1917 version of Gray's Anatomy, it is the combination of the lentiform nucleus (also known as the lenticular nucleus) and the caudate nucleus * According to BrainInfo it is a part of the basal ganglia comprising the globus pallidus and striatum")
