AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001173> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#organ_slim>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001173> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#pheno_slim>)
