AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Wikipedia:Iris_dilator_muscle") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001608> "A smooth muscle of the eye, running radially in the iris that functions as a dilator. [WP,unvetted].")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001608> "It is innervated by the sympathetic system, which acts by releasing noradrenaline, which acts on alpha1-receptors. Thus, when presented with a threatening stimuli that activates the fight-or-flight response, this innervation dilates the iris, thus temporarily letting more light reach the retina")
