SubClassOf(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#notes> "Need to determine whether the fimbria is part of the fornix. Sometimes the language suggests it isn't always thought of that way, but I see no useful reason why it should be separate; it all forms one continuous white matter tract. Neuronames and others include this as part of the hippocampal formation (MM)") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "NIFSTD") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002310> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000052>))
