AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002348> "The visceral pericardium apparently produces the pericardial fluid, which lubricates motion between the inner and outer layers of the pericardium. During ventricular contraction, the wave of depolarization moves from endocardial to epicardial surface. [Wikipedia:Epicardium]")
