AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#date_retrieved> "2012-06-20") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#external_class> "AAO:0010814") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#ontology> "AAO") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "AAO:JMG") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002358> "Serous membrane that forms the lining of the abdominal cavity or the coelom. It covers most of the intra-abdominal organs, supports the abdominal organs, and serves as a conduit for their blood and lymph vessels and nerves. It is composed of a layer of mesothelium.[AAO]")
