AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002424> "consider including separate class for developmental structure (adult human is stratified; in EHDAA2 is unilaminar)")
