AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005411> "In elasmobranchs, the otic capsule remains cartilaginous in the adult; in the embryos of higher vertebrates, it is cartilaginous at first but later becomes bony (at approximately 23 weeks in humans)")
