AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0014526> "the streaming fibers of the anterior internal capsule separate the caudate nucleus and putamen in the human brain (in the mouse brain the caudoputamen is continuous)[ISBN:0123813611]")
